 "description": "<h1>Tutorial Backport</h1>\n<p><strong>The Ground Zero Tutorial for SPT.</strong></p>\n<p>Start a new character and you’ll load into the Tutorial</p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Information</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li><strong>Counts as a real raid.</strong> XP, Skill XP and Loot carries over from the Tutorial. When you extract\nyou keep everything you wear and loot, and your “starter gear” is waiting in the stash.</li>\n<li>The Notes &amp; Tapes stay in <strong>Task items on character</strong> after the tutorial with no purpose unless another mod author takes use of them.</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Not compatible</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li><strong>Fika</strong></li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Bug Reports</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li><strong>Those goes into “issues”</strong></li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Does it work?</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media1.tenor.com/m/rkI1a8s2Z6QAAAAd/todd-howard-it-just-works.gif\" alt=\"gif\" /></p></div></div></div>\n",
